[[Open This|Setting up a silo]]

---

https://docs.oxide.computer/guides/operator/silo-management#_setting_up_a_silo

The procedures for setting up new silos and identity provider integration are similar to those during rack initialization. Operators who have the fleet-admin role can use the Oxide Console, API, or CLI to create a new silo and configure its resource and integration settings.

<div class="custom-note">
  <span class="alert-icon">ℹ</span>
  <strong>Note</strong><br><br>
It is also possible to use IaC tooling such as Terraform to create silos and configure auth. Please refer to the [[Terraform Integration]] guide for additional information.
</div>

